msgctxt "64"
msgid "Ahh!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "76"
msgid "Oh... Excuse me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "88"
msgid "No, it was my fault. Are... Are you okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "100"
msgid "Yeah, I'm fine. Hope I didn't knock into you too hard."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "112"
msgid ""
"Oh, not at all... And by the way, I couldn't help but notice that necklace "
"you have there. It's lovely."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "124"
msgid "(She must mean the Coral Love Necklace.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "136"
msgid "Well, guess I should be going..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"(She actually noticed my necklace... Maybe what that salesman was telling me"
" was true?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid "Hm...?"
msgstr "Mmm..."

msgctxt "220"
msgid "...My wallet! That woman must've been a pickpocket!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid "(She just lifted 50,000 yen right out from under my nose...)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "You lost <Color:8>50,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>50.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"(So much for being lucky. I'd be improving my luck just throwing this thing "
"away.)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"(The only thing she left was the shirt on my back... and I guess my pants, "
"too. But how could I be so careless?)"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid "You lost all your money."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"(So much for being lucky. I'd be improving my luck just throwing this thing "
"away.)"
msgstr ""

